# Proprietary BTicino firmware images must never be committed (copyright /
# redistribution) and would bloat git history. Keep only the folder structure
# and docs; the extracted binaries stay local. See README.md → "Redistribution & git".
*.fwz
*.gz
*.ext4
*.ext4.gz
*.img
mnt/

# ...but keep the structure and docs tracked.
!.gitignore
!README.md
!**/.gitkeep
